@ai-sdk/anthropic still fails sometimes. here's a better workaround i'm using now:
using transformRequestBody to add all missing strings
```javascript
      if (body.messages) {
        for (const msg of body.messages) {
          if (msg.role === 'assistant') {
            if (msg.tool_calls && msg.tool_calls.length > 0) {
              if (!msg.content) {
                msg.content = 'call tool';
              }
              if (!msg.reasoning_content) {
                msg.reasoning_content = 'call tool';
              }
            } else {
              if (!msg.content) {
                msg.content = 'wait user input';
              }
              if (!msg.reasoning_content) {
                msg.reasoning_content = 'answer';
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
```

